1
00:03:06,315 --> 00:03:12,315
Marvel Studios Assembled: The Making of Doctor Strange in the Multiverse
of Madness is a documentary film directed by Brad Baruh.

2
00:06:12,631 --> 00:06:18,631
Join visionary director Sam Raimi and the cast of the film as they recount
their experiences bringing Marvel’s darkest story to life.

3
00:09:18,947 --> 00:09:24,947
From world-building to universe-building, hear first hand accounts from the cast and crew on
what it took to design, create and make each universe unique and believable.

4
00:12:25,263 --> 00:12:31,263
Self - Host / Pizza Poppa, played by Bruce Campbell.

5
00:15:31,578 --> 00:15:37,578
Self - Producer, played by Kevin Feige.

6
